<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Apologize"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="OneRepublic"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Dreaming Out Loud"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM70757102"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440889785"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ryan Tedder</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我紧握着你手中的绳索</text><text for="L2">悬在离地十英尺的半空</text><text for="L3">我听得见你的话语</text><text for="L4">却再也发不出一点声音</text><text for="L5">你说你需要我</text><text for="L6">转身却又将绳索斩断 等等</text><text for="L7">你说你很抱歉</text><text for="L8">没想到我会转过身来对你说</text><text for="L9">如今道歉已经太迟 太迟了</text><text for="L10">我说你的歉意来得太迟 太迟了</text><text for="L11">太迟了</text><text for="L12">Oh, oh</text><text for="L13">我愿再冒一次险</text><text for="L14">愿为你跌落 为你挡下枪弹</text><text for="L15">我需要你 如同心脏需要跳动</text><text for="L16">可这早已不是秘密 是啊</text><text for="L17">我曾以赤红的烈火爱你</text><text for="L18">如今火焰渐渐变蓝 而你说</text><text for="L19">对不起 像极了那位天使</text><text for="L20">上天曾让我以为你就是她 可恐怕</text><text for="L21">如今道歉已经太迟 一切都太迟了</text><text for="L22">我说你的歉意来得太迟 太迟了</text><text for="L23">Whoa</text><text for="L24">如今道歉已经太迟 太迟了</text><text for="L25">我说你的歉意来得太迟 一切都太迟了</text><text for="L26">我说如今道歉已经太迟 是啊 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(太迟了)</span></text><text for="L27">我说你的歉意来得太迟 是啊 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(太迟了)</span></text><text for="L28">我紧握着你的绳索 悬在离地十英尺的半空</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:17.520"><div begin="0:32.593" end="3:17.520"><p begin="0:32.593" end="0:34.353" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.593" end="0:32.753">I'm</span> <span begin="0:32.753" end="0:33.093">hol</span><span begin="0:33.093" end="0:33.403">din'</span> <span begin="0:33.403" end="0:33.633">on</span> <span begin="0:33.633" end="0:33.863">your</span> <span begin="0:33.863" end="0:34.353">rope</span></p><p begin="0:34.363" end="0:38.753" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.363" end="0:34.623">Got</span> <span begin="0:34.623" end="0:34.773">me</span> <span begin="0:34.773" end="0:35.213">ten</span> <span begin="0:35.213" end="0:35.673">feet</span> <span begin="0:35.933" end="0:36.273">off</span> <span begin="0:36.313" end="0:36.483">the</span> <span begin="0:36.483" end="0:38.753">ground</span></p><p begin="0:40.573" end="0:42.483" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.573" end="0:40.723">And</span> <span begin="0:40.723" end="0:40.903">I'm</span> <span begin="0:40.903" end="0:41.303">hear</span><span begin="0:41.303" end="0:41.513">in'</span> <span begin="0:41.513" end="0:41.763">what</span> <span begin="0:41.763" end="0:41.883">you</span> <span begin="0:41.883" end="0:42.483">say</span></p><p begin="0:42.482" end="0:46.074" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.482" end="0:42.762">But</span> <span begin="0:42.762" end="0:42.872">I</span> <span begin="0:42.872" end="0:43.422">just</span> <span begin="0:43.422" end="0:43.862">can't</span> <span begin="0:43.862" end="0:44.486">make</span> <span begin="0:44.486" end="0:44.642">a</span> <span begin="0:44.642" end="0:46.074">sound</span></p><p begin="0:48.858" end="0:51.108" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.858" end="0:48.958">You</span> <span begin="0:48.958" end="0:49.348">tell</span> <span begin="0:49.348" e